  "prefLabel": "Puc 2508.01 Source of Fund",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2508.01 Source of Fund. All alternative compliance payments deposited pursuant to Puc 2503.02 with the state treasurer shall be held in a nonlapsing account to be known as the renewable energy fund. The commission shall account separately for alternative compliance payments received in connection with Class II portfolio standards.\n\nSource. #10741, eff 12-5-14 (from Puc 2507.01); ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2500.html"
